# | Advantech ADAM-4080 — 2-Channel Counter/Frequency Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 16)
# | - 2-channel counter/frequency input + 2 digital outputs.
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01 for coil control; FC03 for counter values and configuration.
# | - FC01 00017 (coil addr 16): DO0 / Counter0 Alarm Status (R/W).
# | - FC01 00018 (coil addr 17): DO1 / Counter1 Alarm Status (R/W).
# | - FC01 00033 (coil addr 32): Counter0 Start/Stop (R/W, 1=start, 0=stop).
# | - FC01 00034 (coil addr 33): Counter0 Clear (W, 1=clear).
# | - FC01 00035 (coil addr 34): Counter0 Overflow (R).
# | - FC01 00037 (coil addr 36): Counter1 Start/Stop (R/W).
# | - FC01 00038 (coil addr 37): Counter1 Clear (W).
# | - FC01 00039 (coil addr 38): Counter1 Overflow (R).
# | - FC03 40001-40002 (addr 0-1): Counter 0 Value (u32, 2 registers).
